; ==============================================================================
;  config\menus\capture-startmenu.rc  -  shared by the themes; no look here (icons come from variables
;  each theme defines: none; empty = no icon).
;  Screen capture tools. Variant for *PopupStartMenu; menus\capture.rc has the same entries for *Popup.
;  Owned by the repo: deploy and the installer overwrite it. Menus cannot be extended
;  from personal.rc (it is read before the theme; see AGENTS.md section 5).
; ==============================================================================
*PopupStartMenu "$TxtScreenSnip$" !Execute [ms-screenclip:]
*PopupStartMenu "$TxtSnippingTool$" !Execute [snippingtool.exe]
*PopupStartMenu "$TxtGameBar$" !Execute [explorer.exe ms-gamebar:]
